Cancelling the voice demo works the way you would expect. Tapping while it is listening now stops it, where before a tap did nothing until the recognizer gave up on its own, and tapping during the countdown now simply cancels instead of immediately listening again. One rule covers the whole screen: a tap starts whatever is not running and stops whatever is. The microphone and its pulse rings are also properly concentric now. The microphone is never involved in operating the real garage door.
